### Create First Memory
POST {{url}}/memories
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A Summer in Kyoto",
  "subtitle": "Temples, bamboo forests, and endless rain",
  "content": "Walking through the quiet paths of Arashiyama at dawn felt like stepping into another world. The morning mist clung to the bamboo stalks as the city slowly woke up.",
  "date": "2026-07-14",
  "visibility": "PRIVATE"
}

###

### Create Second Memory
POST {{url}}/memories
Authorization:{{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "First Ascent of Mount Snowdon",
  "subtitle": "Conquering the highest peak in Wales",
  "content": "The wind howled fiercely as we reached the summit, but the panoramic view of the rugged valleys made every grueling step entirely worth it.",
  "date": "2026-08-02",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC"
}

###

### Get Memory By ID (ID: 1)
GET {{url}}/memories/1
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Memories for User
GET {{url}}/memories
Authorization:{{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Delete Memory (ID: 2)
DELETE {{url}}/memories/2
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Update Memory (ID: 1)
PUT {{url}}/memories/1
Authorization:{{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A Magical Summer in Kyoto (Revised)",
  "subtitle": "Temples, bamboo forests, and lifelong memories",
  "content": "Reflecting back on that trip, walking through Arashiyama at dawn remains my absolute favorite travel moment. The morning mist was unforgettable.",
  "date": "2026-07-15",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC"
}

